Subject: [PATCH] Update ELFIO note parsing

Backport the upstream note accessor updates to ELFIO 3.12. Share record
decoding between scanning and lookup, preserve nameless notes and notes
whose owner name lacks a terminator, keep output parameters unchanged when
a record cannot be read, and keep notes added with add_note() aligned and
consistently indexed.

Upstream: https://github.com/serge1/ELFIO/pull/173
JIRA: SWSPLAT-24318

Remove this backport when updating to a release that includes these changes.

